<title>USA: Defense awards PRIMEX unit $5.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Defense awards PRIMEX unit $5.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense Special Weapons Agency of the U.S. Department of Defense said on Thursday that it awarded $5.1 million to PRIMEX Physics International Co for the development of advanced sources of intense x-ray pulses.</p>
<p>PRIMEX Physics has been granted a $3.4 million three-year contract with options of $1.7 million.</p>
<p>PRIMEX Physics of San Leandro, California, a wholly-owned subsidiary of PRIMEX Technologies Inc, designs and develops advanced non-nuclear, laboratory x-ray testing concepts for satellite components.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
